# SoundPlant demo: afterglow, 88 BPM, D major. Factory sounds only: tools/make_demos.py puts it on the emulator page.
# A slow sunrise in D major. A lone electric-piano figure is the hook; the layers arrive one at a time (a heartbeat, a drone,
# a pad, a sighing flute, a bass that finally lands). The borrowed minor iv (Gm6) keeps tearing the major loop. A half-time
# section, a climb that withholds its last beat, then the bloom: everything at once, a whole step up in E, and home again
# to D where the figure ends the song alone.
# T1 kit (soft heartbeat)  T2 knit finger bass  T3 knit ribbon pad  T4 rayon mellow ep (the hook)  T5 cane breath lead
# T6 voile whisper drone  T7 rayon glass bell  T8 voile ooh choir
# Song: dawn 8, light 8, rising 8 (+ a bar of breath), landing 8, half-time 8, climb 4, bloom 8, bloom 2 8, afterglow 8, ember 4, coda 4.
bpm 88
knob 9 e1 0
knob 9 e2 2
knob 9 e3 0

# ---- the sounds
# T1 the kit: a soft heartbeat first; a light backbeat only when the song lands
knob 1 d1.k1 72
knob 1 d1.k2 62
knob 1 d1.k3 44
knob 1 d1.k4 48
knob 1 d1.volume 82
knob 1 d2.k1 66
knob 1 d2.k2 70
knob 1 d2.k3 70
knob 1 d2.k4 72
knob 1 d2.volume 78
knob 1 d2.send2 76
knob 1 d5.volume 56
knob 1 d5.send2 50
knob 1 d3.volume 36
knob 1 d4.volume 36
knob 1 d9.volume 40
knob 1 d9.send1 14
knob 1 level 88
# T2 a knit finger bass: round, a little low-pass
preset 2 finger_bass knit
param 2 oct 2
knob 2 brain 2
knob 2 cut 62
knob 2 level 84
# T3 a knit ribbon pad: three-note voicings that move by step
preset 3 ribbon knit
param 3 oct 2
knob 3 brain 2
knob 3 e3 1
knob 3 r 64
knob 3 level 72
knob 3 pan 66
knob 3 send2 40
# T4 a rayon mellow electric piano: the ostinato, the hook
preset 4 mellow_ep rayon
param 4 oct 2
knob 4 brain 2
knob 4 level 96
knob 4 pan 58
knob 4 send1 16
knob 4 send2 34
# T5 a cane breath lead: the sigh, then the bloom's tune
preset 5 breath_lead cane
param 5 oct 2
knob 5 brain 2
knob 5 level 92
knob 5 pan 76
knob 5 send1 34
knob 5 send2 40
# T6 a voile whisper pad: a slow drone with a filter that breathes
preset 6 whisper_pad voile
param 6 oct 2
knob 6 brain 2
knob 6 r 66
knob 6 level 56
knob 6 pan 32
knob 6 send2 60
# T7 a rayon glass bell: glints, doublings, the hook quoted slowly
preset 7 glass_bell rayon
param 7 oct 2
knob 7 brain 2
knob 7 level 66
knob 7 pan 100
knob 7 send1 40
knob 7 send2 56
# T8 a voile ooh choir: one long guide tone a bar
preset 8 ooh_choir voile
param 8 oct 2
knob 8 brain 2
knob 8 r 72
knob 8 level 68
knob 8 pan 44
knob 8 send2 60
# FX I a slow echo, FX II a big hall
knob 11 engine delay
knob 11 e1 108
knob 11 e3 46
knob 11 e4 44
knob 12 engine hall
knob 12 e2 88
knob 12 e3 58
mst lo 60
mst hi 46
mst comp 44
mst pump 0
mst release 74
mst level 104

